# the drone stays low and warm in every key and scale: its root 190..300 Hz (or the nearest
# octave, never under 150 Hz), its upper note never above 400 Hz. (the player's key and scale
# set by the host, keystep / scalestep: in a scene SELECT and ALGORITHM turn Activity and the Mood)
